<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower on Wednesday in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 591.79, down 3.66.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 350 to 160.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.09.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,253,150 compared with 18,608,520 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
